neral \nInsurance Company Limited., (ix) SBI General Insurance Company Limited, (x) \nUniversal Sompo General Insurance Company Limited, (xi) Shriram Ge\nneral Insurance \nCo. Limited, (xii) Royal Sunaram General Insurance Company Limited and (xiii) Bharti \nAxa General Insurance Company Limited have also been empanelled for \nimplementation of the scheme.\n \n \n\nContd…2/\n-\n \n \n \n-\n2\n-\n \n \n \n(b):\n \nPercentage share of Agriculture I\nnsurance Company of India Ltd. (AIC) on gross \npremium in the country was 56%, 63% and 36% during 2014\n-\n15, 2015\n-\n16 and 2016\n-\n17 \nrespectively.    However, share of all the Public Sector insurance companies including \nAIC during 2016\n-\n17 is more than 50%.\n \n(c):\n \nS\ntate\n-\nwise details of number of farmers insured and benefitted under the scheme \nduring last three years i.e. 2014\n-\n15 to 2016\n-\n17 are given in \nAnnexure\n.\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \nANNEXUR\nE\nState wise details of No. of Framers insured \nand Be\nne\nfitted for last 3 years\n \nSl\n.\n \nN\no.\n \nState\n \n2014\n-\n15\n \n2015\n-\n16\n \n2016\n-\n17\n \nNo. of \nFarmers \nInsured\n \nNo. of \nFarmers \nBenefitted\n \nNo. of \nFarmers \nInsured\n \nNo. of \nFarmers \nBenefitted\n \nNo. of \nFarmers \nInsured\n \nNo. of \nFarmers \nBenefitted\n \n1\n \nANDHRA PRADESH\n \n405745\n \n115390\n \n1717533\n \n418441\n \n1771557\n \n877241\n \n2\n \nASSAM\n \n49889\n \n22203\n \n45736\n \n24425\n \n60265\n \n23370\n \n3\n \nBIHAR\n \n3874082\n \n2500014\n \n3091612\n \n1123440\n \n2713178\n \n149698\n \n4\n \nCHHATTISGARH\n \n1068387\n \n596577\n \n1283176\n \n677382\n \n1549164\n \n135221\n \n5\n \nGOA\n \n160\n \n0\n \n136\n \n82\n \n757\n \n111\n \n6\n \nGUJARAT\n \n660856\n \n191722\n \n504170\n \n363027\n \n1975192\n \n500219\n \n7\n \nHARYANA\n \n22\n \n7\n \n0\n \n0\n \n1335984\n \n216683\n \n8\n \nHIMACHAL PRADESH\n \n131